  "description": "<p class=\"brush: css notranslate\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>A soft powder blush that delivers watercolor-like shades inspired by fruit</span></p>\n<p>Product Description:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colors inspired by natural dried fruits</li>\n<li>Gives natural, My Cheek But Better, rosy cheeks</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Product Details:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">Soft blurring effect with a silky, powdery finish</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Sits weightless and mess-free</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Application Tips:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">Load your brush with a moderate amount of product</li>\n<li>Lightly tap the brush to remove excess powder</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">Start applying at the highest points of your cheeks</li>\n</ul>",
